71146596128194_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=W2GUXOy80PQQ7kNvwHCAYig&_nc_oc=Adp9p6zx7LCg02L-1tGQKj_t5LTWa9RhwrWISi4cLciDdnZV8X9pI5kqb12xIY6xYZg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAl_c5zqK4UpzrSp9Iv0ogOeq1MM4xyQlzxSGMRtyU0_Q&oe=6A5786B9"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "2116332565928774", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622315_2116332569262107_6472776043868426897_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Zt5a7ylx_KEQ7kNvwGIwuud&_nc_oc=Ado7Kz33V7gD7PSsXEeszO6LN_ErBW7jBHqNK3NI92Suz6u9_hzejNyzur8MI-kYpUE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDnIYFyqVqxpKsCHdteENzcEfK8o7DwXem-cevpBN14BA&oe=6A579993"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "909457358817429", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623558_909457362150762_5574869297430657880_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5pnM7mL8CcMQ7kNvwGoJG2t&_nc_oc=AdoHXWd029LIIAxXhkJ_XTmMYHkwF4BIiez-C4cGXvYgQf8x5tnYlHB9WJJKeZ5GsFE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAzAzrgr_Fe3y_wcwDNrZToB39Ms8w7iqosxIf4hkezfg&oe=6A5797DA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wild", "keywords": ["social", "free", "hangout", "friends", "chat"], "long_description": "**Explore with friends.**\n\nWild is one big social space. Walk across the map, follow the noise, visit other players, or let your curiosity lead the way.\n\n**Life as a duck.**\n\nCustomize your duck avatar, and express yourself in ways only possible inside VR. Walk, run, or jump around with hand-based movement.\n\n**Welcome to the community.**\n\nWhen you join Wild, you\u2019re joining a new world that is constantly changing. Tune into events, changes to the map, or try out the latest cosmetics.\n", "short_description": "Wild is a social VR hangout world. Explore a shared city, meet friends, and host events."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https: